49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, the meeting space is more expensive, but it solves the talking problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I think the meeting space is best. We can book it and stop the mess.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I prefer the quiet room. I need silence. The wall is too thin for noise.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,I’m leaning towards the quiet room. It reduces the callouts and the mess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
